s, 'As I said, it would be wrong for me to offer you any contract to do such a thing. What you do on your own is of no concern to me.'\n\n---\n\n**Task Window:** Ashen Wandering Horizon, though some confusing manipulation of the rules that govern activities in the realms of the jann, has deemed it reasonable to ask you, a mortal, to help them breach the defenses of Stratos.\n1\\. Defeat the residents of Stratos on behalf of the Empyr invaders. 0/9 Stratos: Zephyr's Flight\nKill anything back on the other side of the Brass Phoenix Brigade's picket line that you passed to get to Ashen Wandering Horizon. Armors, djinn's, phoenixes, mephit's, gales, gusts and dervishes are all confirmed to give updates. The very first island back has more than enough NPCs to kill to get all your updates, but anything further back seems to work fine too.\n2\\. Speak with Ashen Wandering Horizon about your success 0/1 Stratos: Zephyr's Flight\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n212 Platinum, 5 Gold\nIncreases your faction with Lords of Aalishai\n**Submitted by:** Gidono\n- Increases your faction with Lords of Aalishai.",
