      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Stratos: Zephyr's Flight [zone=1208]\n**Who:**\n- Iron Lightning Spirit [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Faction\n- Money\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Bloom [npc=54073]\n- Still Ore [npc=54044]\n- a petitioner [npc=54035]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Partisan of Stratos: Zephyr's Flight (10 Points) [quest=9234]\n**Era:** | !The Burning Lands\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Oct 31 05:28:35 2018\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | Prerequisites: None\nThis is a shared task.\nTalk to Iron Lightning Spirit in Stratos out on a purple platform straight west of the zone in. Say accept to Soaring Moon [npc=54026] to be ported over to the platform.\nYou say, 'Hail, Iron Lightning Spirit'\nIron Lightning Spirit says, 'I believe we have heard of you. As you seem to have obtained some favor here, I can offer a suggestion. If you truly wish to gain status here, you could [aid] the Udex with their tasks, even though they may not even know they are in need of assistance.'\nYou say, 'aid'\nIron Lightning Spirit says, 'Each requires assistance of a different type. I can only advise you to consider who you wish to aid. If, as one new here might, you wished to be well considered by the Udex, then someone might remove annoyances from their lives.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'A Petitioner's Plight'.\n\n---\n\n**Task Window:** Iron Lightning Spirit has, in a rather cryptic fashion, has offered you a way to ingratiate yourself with the Udex in Stratos. He has asked you to remove petitioners that have been rejected but have not yet left Stratos, in any way you must. Most rejected petitioners have no rights here at all, and it is acceptable to kill them. So maybe do that.\n2. Remove unwanted petitioners 0/4 Stratos: Zephyr's Flight\n\n\n\n**Task Window:** Iron Lightning Spirit has, in a rather cryptic fashion, offered you a way to ingratiate yourself with the Udex in Stratos. He has asked you to remove petitioners that have been rejected but have not yet left stratos, in any way you must.\n\n\n\n\nMost rejected petitioners have no rights here at all, and it is acceptable to kill them. So maybe do that.\n\n\n\n\nKill petitioners scattered throughout the zone.\n\n3. Find and get rid of some of the more persistent petitioners. 0/2 Stratos: Zephyr's Flight\n\n\n\n**Task Window:** Some petitioners remain in a murky status for reasons no mortal seems to understand. Those need to be removed too.\n\n\n\n\nSpeak with Still Ore and kill him twice.\n\n\nNote : on 12/11/18, I killed Steel Ore once and killed Bloom once.\n\n\n\nYou say, 'Hail, Still Ore.'\n\n\n\n\nStill Ore breaks from deep, scowling, thought. 'What!? Oh, only a mortal. You should not disturb me. I have vengeance to plan. If you don't want that [vengeance] drected at you, you should consider more carefully who you bother.'\n\n\n\n\nYou say, 'vengeance'\n\n\n\n\nStill Ore says, 'A djinn committed a great crime against me and I seek revenge. The Udex of the duende will not listen to my petition claiming that they cannot rule over the actions of a djinn. So I have been forced to come here to get the attention of the Udex of Stratos. No matter the effort required, I will have [what was taken] from me.'\n\n\n\n\nYou say 'what was taken'\n\n\n\n\nStill Ore says, 'The djinn stole a great muhbis from me, a rare blue ruby holding an ancient efreeti bound to me.'\n\n\n\n\nStill Ore says, 'You do not have a warrant to be here. I must end your poor mortal existence.'\n\n4. Return to Iron Lightning Spirit 0/1 Stratos: Zephyr's Flight\n\n\n\n**Task Window:** Let Iron Lightning Spirit know that you have succeeded.\n\n\n\n\nHail him.\n\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n283 platinum 3 gold 3 silver 3 copper\nYou gain experience!\n**Submitted by:** Gidono\n- 283pp, 3g, 3s, 3cp, Experience",
