      walkthrough = "**Status: Unsolved**\n\nQuest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Stratos: Zephyr's Flight [zone=1208]\n**Who:**\n- Iron Lightning Spirit [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Faction\n- Money\n**Faction Required:**\nServants of Esianti (Min: Dubious)\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Servants of Esianti +200\n**Factions Lowered:**\n- Servants of Aalishai -200\n- Servants of Loruella -200\n- Servants of Mearatas -200\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a flameling - Stratos: Zephyr's Fight! - 1 [ _Brass Phoenix Brigade_]\n- a jopal soldier [npc=54059]\n- a pyre armor [ _Brass Phoenix Brigade_]\n- an efreeti knight [ _Brass Phoenix Brigade_]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Mercenary of Stratos: Zephyr's Flight (10 Points) [quest=9233]\n**Era:** | !The Burning Lands\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Oct 31 21:13:59 2018\nModified: Fri Oct 4 22:16:43 2024 | | Requirements: You must be \"threatening\" to Servants of Esianti to get the task.\nThis is obtained from Iron Lightning Spirit in Stratos at -20, +395, +102 on a platform. To get to the platform, say \"accept\" to Soaring Moon [npc=54026] near him.\nYou say, 'Hail, Iron Lightning Spirit'\nIron Lightning Spirit says, 'Ah, another stranger. I have been given the instruction to speak with any that make it this far and determine their [worthiness]. Surely you understand that you are [not welcome] here? Only bad things can come of you mortals having found your way here unbidden.'\nYou say, 'What is my worthiness?'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Earning One's Place'.\nIron Lightning Spirit says, 'One's worthiness is difficult to define and will hold different value to different individuals. Yours is undoubtedly low, as you have forced your way into our realm. Your arrival here, the first thing you have done here, breaks our rules. It is hard to find value in one that has done such. But it is my task to do so. To that end I may be able to offer you a way to prove your worth with me. While I cannot confer upon you greatness by offering you my acclaim, it will certainly be better than you are now.'\n\n---\n\n1\\. Gain favor with the Djinn by assisting in their war with the Efreeti 0/5 Stratos: Zephyr's Flight\nKill fire and smoke type mobs near the Plane of Smoke zone-in.\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n212pp 5 gold\nYour task 'Earning One's Place' has been updated.\nPerhaps you have aided the Djinn.\nYour faction standing with Servants of Esianti has been adjusted by 200.\nYour faction standing with Servants of Aalishai has been adjusted by -200.\nYour faction standing with Servants of Mearatas has been adjusted by -200.\nYour faction standing with Servants of Loruella has been adjusted by -200.\n**Submitted by:** Larth\n- Faction with Djinn",
