tone to Dusky Iron Meditation so that the contract can be completed. 0/1 Stratos: Zephyr's Flight\n\n\n\n\n\n> **Task Window:** ?\n\n\n\nReturn to and Turn in the Warrant to Dusky Iron Meditation.\n\n\n\n\n**(Dialogue?)**\n\n\n\nYou have been given: Writ of Entry - Esianti [quest=9264] **(Will need this uploaded via the item collector when it's working again.)**\n\n12. Speak with Dusky Iron Meditation. 0/1 Stratos: Zephyr's Flight\n\n\n\n\n\n> **Task Window:** ?\n\n\n\nHail Dusky Iron Meditation.\n\n13. Tell Great Sky Ocean that you have the key to enter Esianti. 0/1 Stratos: Zephyr's Flight\n\n\n\n\n\n> **Task Window:** ?\n\n\n\nYou say, 'Hail, Great Sky Ocean'\n\n\n\n\nYour task 'Key to the Kingdom' has been updated.\n\n\n\n\nGreat Sky Ocean says, 'Well done! With that key you can seek the contract that Moon Serf of Harmonious Heavens must have signed. I can send you there, now that you have the right to enter, when you are ready to take on the [mission] set before you.'\n\n\n---\n\n**Version #4**\n03. Find Dusky Iron Meditation's servant, Unfettered Stone 0/1 Stratos: Zephyr's Flight\n\n\n\n\n\n> **Task Window:** ?\n\n\n\nThis is a Pile of Rubble that is a ground spawn in several spots in Stratos. Picked it up. Can pre-loot.\n\n04. Return the remains of Unfettered Stone to Dusky Iron Meditation 0/1 Stratos: Zephyr's Flight\n\n\n\n\n\n> **Task Window:** ?\n\n\n\nJust handed it to him.\n\n05. Find out how Unfettered Stone Died 0/1 Stratos: Zephyr's Flight\n\n\n\n\n\n> **Task Window:** ?\n\n\n\nHailed \"a hidden mephit.\" Just followed along. I found \"a furtive dwarf\" one island over. Killed it and looted \"Gemstone Heart of Unfettered Stone.\"\n\n06. Return the gemstone heart of Unfettered Stone to Dusky Iron Meditation 0/1 Stratos: Zephyr's Flight\n\n\n\n\n\n> **Task Window:** ?\n\n\n\nGave the Gemstone Heart of Unfettered Stone to Dusky Iron Meditation. He will gave me a \"Clear Heart of Unfettered Stone.\"\n\n07. Bring Dusky Iron Meditation's evidence to an Udex and convince them to hear his case. 0/1 Stratos: Zephyr's Flight\n\n\n\n\n\n> **Task Window:** ?\n\n\n\nGave the Clear Heart of Unfettered Stone to Udex Cloud Breaking Warrior. I got it right back.\n\n08. Give the warrant stone to Dusky Iron Meditation so that the contract can be completed. 0/1 Stratos: Zephyr's Flight\n\n\n\n\n\n> **Task Window:** ?\n\n\n\nReturned the Clear Heart of Unfettered Stone (there is no item called a \"Warrant Stone\"). This spawned \"an empowered agent.\" They talked.\n\n09. Speak with Dusky Iron Meditation. 0/1 Stratos: Zephyr's Flight\n\n\n\n\n\n> **Task Window:** ?\n\n\n\nHailed and he gave me a \"Writ of Entry - Esianti.\"\n\n10. Tell Great Sky Ocean that you have a key to enter Esianti. 0/1 Stratos: Zephyr's Flight\n\n\n\n\n\n> **Task Window:** ?\n\n\n\nHailed Great Sky Ocean to finish the task.\n\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\nExperience\n283 Platinum, 3 Gold, 3 Silver, 3 Copper\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
