      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Stratos: Zephyr's Flight [zone=1208]\n**Who:**\n- Great Sky Ocean [ _Quests and Mission_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Breeze Silk [item=135694]\n- Discarded Note [item=134828]\n- Everwarm Bread [item=134722]\n- General's Writ - Brass Phoenix [item=134721]\n- General's Writ - Golden Star [item=134754]\n- General's Writ - Silver Spear [item=134755]\n- Golden Beryl [item=133120]\n- Golden Hilted Dagger [item=134610]\n- Jagged Emblem Platinum Amulet [item=134733]\n- Letter of Support [item=134806]\n- Letter of Support [item=134805]\n- Letter of Support [item=134807]\n- Letter of Support [item=134808]\n- Lightning Essence [item=133124]\n- Nine Rose Dust [item=134804]\n- Water-etched Vial [item=135693]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Esianti: Palace of the Winds [zone=1211]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Dance of Metal and Ivory [npc=54361]\n- Daughter of the Invincible Sun [npc=54231]\n- Hidden Winds [ _Silver Spear General_]\n- Maiden of Nine Roses [npc=54365]\n- Remembrance Consuming Sage [ _Council of Esianti_]\n- Silent White Sky [npc=54238]\n- Wistful Silken Fist [ _Brass Phoenix General_]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Brass Palace [quest=9445]\n- Fight Fire [quest=9263]\n- Key to the Kingdom [quest=9264]\n- Palace of Embers [quest=9433]\n- Prisoner's Dilemma [quest=9265]\n- Soldier of Air [quest=9225]\n- Trial of Three (Trial of Smoke) [quest=9281]\n- Trial of the Ashes of Rusted Cliff's Glory (Trial of Smoke) [quest=9335]\n- Trial of the Eternal Cyclone (Trial of Smoke) [quest=9336]\n- Trial of the Speaker's Amphitheater (Trial of Smoke) [quest=9282]\n- Trial of the Wending Ways (Trial of Smoke) [quest=9337]\n**Era:** | !The Burning Lands\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Mon Nov 5 03:44:29 2018\nModified: Tue Apr 7 06:42:59 2026 | | Prerequisite Quests: Soldier of Air [quest=9225], Fight Fire [quest=9263], and any one of Trial of Smoke tasks, Prisoner's Dilemma, Palace of Embers, Brass Palace, Key to the Kingdom, and Contract of War.\nYou can get this shared task from Great Sky Ocean [npc=54050] in Stratos at -80, +677, +238 on the island straight west of the entrance.\nGreat Sky Ocean says, 'It is good to see you again, Gidono. Once again I must offer my gratitude for your willingness to help stop the war and [see it through], despite the risks. You have been able to [find] solutions that my people would not. You even took on the most dangerous [mission] of entering Esianti to confront our king. Now you must [work] on his behalf and try to convince powerful beings in Esianti to support him.'\nYou say, 'work'\nGreat Sky Ocean says, 'Wonderful to know. I still cannot enter there, you must tackle this on your own. Beware, mortal, that my people do not like yours very much. You may need to prove your worth to them.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'All Hail the King'.\n\n---\n\n1\\. Speak with Silent White Sky and convince him to support the new king. 0/1 Esianti: Palace of the Winds\n> **Task Window:** Moon Serf of Harmonius Heavens has promised to end the way with the efreeti if you can sway some djinn to more fully support him. These are eccentric djinn with what the king believes is an inordinate amount of political influence. he has asked you to do whatever you must to gain a letter of support for the king from these djinn and deliver them to his seneschal.\n>\n> Silent White Sky is a pacifist. Moon Serf of Harmonius Heavens used the term 'overly sensitive' when describing him. Finding a way to gain his support may be extremely challenging.\n>\n> Maiden of Nine Roses was described as full of whimsy. You can expect to not know what to expect when speaking with her.\n>\n> Daughter of the Invincible Sunrise was once a strong supporter of Moon Serf of Harmonius Heavens, but has been cold to him lately. Find out why and gain her support.\n>\n> Dance of Metal and Ivory is responsible for designing much of the architecture in Esianti. He is ancient djinn and ardent craftsman. The king has no idea how to appease someone who i s only concerned with art, something the king knows nothing about.\nSay 'support for the king' then go through the text.\n2\\. Deliver the three writs to Silent White Sky. 0/3 Esianti: Palace of the Winds\nKill those NPCs and loot a Writ from each :\n\\- Still Sky`s Scholar : drops General's Writ - Golden Star\n\\- Hidden Winds : drops General's Writ - Silver Spear\n\\- Wistful Silken Fist : drops General's Writ - Brass Phoenix\nDeliver the 3 writs to Silent White Sky. Each group member receives Letter of Support.\n3\\. Speak with Maiden of Nine Roses and convince her to support the new king. 0/1 Esianti: Palace of theWinds\nSay 'support for the king' then go through the text. Each group member receives Nine Rose Dust.\n4\\. Light a Fire in the Boldness of Great Substantiveness. 0/1 Esianti: Palace of the Winds\nKill jopals in the North West area and loot 2 Mephit's Flames, then use one in the South West building.\n5\\. Flavor the water on Isle of Radiant Mist. Do so under the island falls. 0/1 Esianti: Palace of the Winds\nClick the Nine Rose Dust at the water falls, around /loc +300, -1700. Mobs will aggro.\n6\\. Give some of the brume armors a better appearance. 0/5 Esianti: Palace of the Winds\nClick the Nine Rose Dust you were given on Brume Armors, they will turn pink.\n7\\. Give a mortal a hot foot. 0/1 Esianti: Palace of the Winds\nUse a Mephit's Flame on the Norrathians in the South East building.\n8\\. Return to the Rose Dust to Maiden of Nine Roses and report your success and survival. 0/1 Esianti: Palace of the Winds\nTurn in the Rose Dust to Maiden of Nine Roses. Each group member receives Letter of Support.\n9\\. Speak with Daughter of the Invincible Sun and convince her to support the new king. 0/1 Esianti: Palace of the Winds\nSay 'support for the king', then go through the text.\n10\\. Defeat one of the council members in a sanctioned fight in front of witnesses. 0/1 Esianti: Palace of the Winds\nRemembrance Consuming Sage [npc=54229] or Lightning's Light [npc=54362], say 'insult' when it is near any mob in the area, then DPS it to 9%\nWarning! It must be near another mob to get this update.\n11\\. Tell Daughter of the Invincible Sun about your success 0/1 Esianti: Palace of the Winds\nHail, then go through the text. Each group member receives Letter of Support.\n12\\. Speak with Dance of Metal and Ivory and convince him to support the new king. 0/1 Esianti: Palace of the Winds\nSay 'support for the king', then go through the text.\n13\\. Deliver a beautiful crafted item to Dance of Metal and Ivory that appears that the king of the djinn might have made it. 0/1 Esianti: Palace of the Winds\nCraft the item of your choice :\n\\- Baking : Everwarm Bread [item=134722], combine: 2 Unebbing Ember [item=133122] \\+ 4 Phoenix Dough [item=17461] \\+ Bread Tin [item=15159].\n\\- Blacksmithing : Golden Hilted Dagger [item=134610], combine : 2 Golden Beryl [item=133120] \\+ 1 Dagger Blade Mold [item=14304] \\+ 1 Hilt Mold [item=14301] \\+ 1 Drunder's Steel [item=17970].\n\\- Jewelcrafting : Jagged Emblem Platinum Amulet [item=134733], combine : 2 Lightning Essence [item=133124] \\+ 1 Emblem of Storms [item=17526] \\+ 1 Platinum Bar [item=14324].\n\\- Tailoring : Breeze Silk [item=135694], combine : 2 Captured Breeze [item=133123] \\+ 6 Air Arachnid Silk String [item=20210].\nThere is one other recipe to be confirmed :\n\\- Pottery : it looks like Pure Drop [item=133121] is used for a recipe (maybe called Water-etched Vial ?) related to Odylic Vial [item=20756], **please confirm**.\nNote that those recipes are NOT learned, and that they have a very high trivial > 350. Also, ANYONE can craft the item for you since all the items are tradeable.\nDeliver the item to Dance of Metal and Ivory. Each group member receives Letter of Support.\n14\\. Each of these beings will need to hand over a note showing support for the king. 0/4 Esianti: Palace of the Winds\nTurn in the 4 Letters of Support to Sky Orchid Understanding.\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n425 platinum\nYou gain experience!\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
