again I must offer my gratitude for your willingness to help stop the war and [see it through], despite the risks. You have been able to [find] solutions that my people would not. You even took on the most dangerous [mission] of entering Esianti to confront our king. Now you must [work] on his behalf and try to convince powerful beings in Esianti to support him.'\nYou say, 'see it through'\nGreat Sky Ocean says, 'Wonderful! I can expedite your travel to the palace, when you are [ready]. I wish you the best of luck!'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Brass Palace'.\nYou say, 'ready'\nGreat Sky Ocean says, 'Off you go!'\nLOADING, PLEASE WAIT...\nYou have entered Aalishai: Palace of Embers.\nThis ports you just right outside the castle.\n\n---\n\n1\\. Defeat the guards and get into the palace. 0/1 ALL\n> **Task Window:** You have been asked to find and recover a contract of some sort that might have been signed by the queen of the efreeti, Heart of Flawless Brass. Should you succeed, Great Sky Ocean would like to discuss with you what happens next.\n>\n> You, of course, have writ for the palace and should be able to open the doors, if you can remove any magical barriers. Defeat the guards of protecting the palace doors and end their magic holding the doors closed.\nKill pyreglare armors until you spawn Silent Sun [npc=54487], kill it. He will call nearby mobs to his aid. When he's dead, the door to the palace will be unlocked.\nDO NOT BE ON THE BRIDGE WHEN IT POPS.\nHINT: This mob has a DS, the tank must turn off attack.\n2\\. Defeat the guards and get into the throne room. 0/1 Aalishai: Palace of Embers\n> **Task Window:** Defeat the guards protecting the throne room doors. Only killing them will remove the magic they use to keep the queen safe.\nKill your way into the Palace, until Ash Wrathful [npc=54483] spawns, kill it while avoiding the fire elementals. Kill mobs them until Ashful Wrathful pops and 4 none-aggro mobs that have a AURA on them. When he's dead, throne room is open.\n3\\. Defeat the guards and get into the queen's bedroom. 0/1 Aalishai: Palace of Embers\n> **Task Window:** Defeat the throne room guards in order to enter the queen's bedroom.\nContinue East killing mobs in the Throne Room, Discipline of Flame [npc=54482] spawns, kill it. There are 6 mobs set up as two pairs, kill them and a named will pop.\nDiscipline of Flame collapses. Runes glow for a moment on the door on the north wall of the chamber.\n4\\. Find evidence of the queen's involvement in the war between the djinn and efreeti. 0/1 Aalishai: Palace of Embers\n> **Task Window:** Recover the war contract, if you can.\nIn the queen's bedroom on the table, is a Note on Brass [item=134793], pick it up and right-click it.\n5\\. Open the chest. 0/1 Aalishai: Palace of Embers\n> **Task Window:** You may as well open the chest, I mean it's just sitting there...\nOpen the chest.\nYour task 'Brass Palace' has been updated.\nYou have received a replay timer for 'Brass Palace': 0d:5h:22m remaining.\nGreat Sky Ocean wanted you to speak with her if you were successful so she could advise you further.\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n212 platinum 5 gold\nYou gain experience!\n96 Fettered Ifrit Coins [item=134362]\n\n---\n\nBrass Palace - All Achievements - YouTube\nTap to unmute\nBrass Palace - All Achievements jimmyw404\njimmyw404219 subscribers\nWatch on\n**Submitted by:** Gidono\n- Blue Sky [item=134078]\n- Conquering Blade of Stars [item=134069]\n- Fettered Ifrit Coin [item=134362]\n- Lesser Spellbound Lamp [item=134302]\n- Mortal Corporeal Deft Zephyr [item=134086]",
