      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Stratos: Zephyr's Flight [zone=1208]\n**Who:**\n- Great Sky Ocean [ _Quests and Mission_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Time:** | 360\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Related Zones:**\n- Esianti: Palace of the Winds: Contract of War [zone=1222]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Feather Silver Sheen [npc=54510]\n- Moon Serf of Harmonious Heavens [npc=54504]\n- Radiant Fog Evening [npc=54511]\n- Sunshine Sensible Warmth [npc=54476]\n- a lofty chest [npc=54475]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Brass Palace [quest=9445]\n- Fight Fire [quest=9263]\n- Key to the Kingdom [quest=9264]\n- Palace of Embers [quest=9433]\n- Prisoner's Dilemma [quest=9265]\n- Soldier of Air [quest=9225]\n- Trial of Three (Trial of Smoke) [quest=9281]\n- Trial of the Ashes of Rusted Cliff's Glory (Trial of Smoke) [quest=9335]\n- Trial of the Eternal Cyclone (Trial of Smoke) [quest=9336]\n- Trial of the Speaker's Amphitheater (Trial of Smoke) [quest=9282]\n- Trial of the Wending Ways (Trial of Smoke) [quest=9337]\n**Era:** | !The Burning Lands\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Nov 28 03:14:23 2018\nModified: Sun Mar 1 01:12:02 2026 | | Prerequisite Quests: Soldier of Air, Fight Fire, and any one Trial of Smoke, Prisoner's Dilemma, Palace of Embers, Brass Palace, and Key to the Kingdom.\nYou can get this shared task from Great Sky Ocean in Stratos at -82, +679, +239. She is on the find tool (CTRL F).\nThis is a shared task.\nYou say, 'mission'\nGreat Sky Ocean says, 'Good! I am glad you are still willing. I will send you to Esianti whenever you are ready [to go].'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Contract of War'.\nYou say, 'to go'\nLOADING, PLEASE WAIT...\nYou have entered Esianti: Palace of the Winds.\nIt ports you to the building in the south part of the zone with all the norrathians.\n\n---\n\n1\\. Find and defeat whomever is palace guardian today and acquire a writ to see the king. 0/1 Esianti: Palace of the Winds\n> **Task Window:** Great Sky Ocean has told you that there must be a second contract sanctioning the war between the djinn and efreeti, and that Moon Serf of Harmonious Heavens must have it. She also mentioned that she does not trust the new king, and others in Esianti do not either. Despite having a write for Esianti, you do not believe the locals will appreciate your arrival. Find and take the contract and return it to Great Sky Ocean.\n>\n> You will have to draw out the palace guardian. There are three beings that currently serve that position, and one of them must have a writ to speak with the king.\n3 red cons and one of them will drop the Writ of Access - King in Esianti [quest=9446]. Order will not always been the same every task.\nNamed are:\nFeather Silver Sheen - Casts Gouging Strike (Single Target, Unresistable, 155,105 dmg per tick dot (4 ticks)) Can spawn a nilborien hawk [npc=54509] around 10-20 seconds into the fight and will despawn if you lose aggro on Feather Silver Sheen.\nRadiant Fog Evening - Casts Suffocating Breeze (Single Target, Unresistable, 88,888 dmg per tick dot (4 ticks), curse counters 25. DT if not cured before dot wears off?)\nSunshine Sensible Warmth - Casts Crippling Knives (Single Target, Unresistable, 135,145 dmg nuke, decrease mana 4500, decrease movement by 85%), also\nCasts Lashing Blades (Directional AE 250', Unresistable, 116,126 dmg per tick (4 ticks), 135,135 dmg nuke)\n\\- The first named is by the bridge and the two adds can be pulled and killed first.\n\\- The second is on the hill solo.\n\\- The third is by the entryway and has two adds that can be pulled and killed first.\nNOTE: - Two mephits rush you after the last named dies. The key will poof from your inventory if you die, so be sure to run up and open the door as soon as you can. The Moon Serf will only talk to you after you kill those 2 mephits.\nIf you wipe: If you wipe on the first or second boss, just run back, rebuff and try again. If you wipe after the 3rd, the two mephits that spawned will slowly pace towards the first person to zone back in (they don't really \"aggro\" until they reach you). They can be rooted, snared and mezzed and both occasionally cast a knockback and blind.\nNOTE - Not a step but you should pre-clear the landing before the door and the two guards at the door. Before using the Writ on the door which will start the spawning of the Mephits.\n2\\. Speak with the king about the war. 0/1 Esianti: Palace of the Winds\n> **Task Window:** You will have to enter the chamber the king is currently using for meetings and hope the contract is there. If not, you will have to speak with the king and see if you can gain some traction in convincing him to stop the war himself.\nWith the writ in your inventory, click on the Moon Serf of Harmonious Heavens door (from the entrance looking north the 1st two level one BLUE DOOR, which is at the eastern most plateau at the complex in the center of the zone.). Make sure to kill the guards at the blue door and the mobs on the plateau below guards and the roamer in the center before you kill the last boss. Also, kill the mephits after the 3rd mini-boss dies. When they are dead, say 'do you know who will follow' to Moon Serf of Harmonious Heavens on one of the platforms.\nMap File Location for Moon: P 389.7311, 237.7524, -11.8736, 240, 0, 0, 3, Moon\\_Serf\\_of\\_Harmonious\\_Heavens\\_(Contract\\_of\\_War)\nMobs spawn on his platform frequently so you will need to clear.\nSay \"I will do it\" and the chest should spawn.\n3\\. Open the Chest. 0/1 Esianti: Palace of the Winds\n> **Task Window:** no text\nOpen \"a lofty chest\".\n\n---\n\n**Chest Loot:**\n(a lofty chest)\nBattleworn Stalwart Moon Binding slot Muhbis\nBlue Sky\nDiminished Inhabited Muhbis\nGirdle of the Moon\nAll Spellbound Lamp's\nMortal Celestial Brawny Spark\nMortal Celestial Deft Spark\nMortal Celestial Equilibrium Spark\nMortal Celestial Incisive Spark\nMortal Corporeal Light Zephyr\nMortal Celestial Nimble Spark\nMortal Celestial Vigorous Spark\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n212 platinum 5 gold\nYou gain experience!\n96 Fettered Ifrit Coins\n**Submitted by:** Gidono\n- Blue Sky [item=134078]\n- Diminished Inhabited Muhbis [item=133142]\n- Fettered Ifrit Coin [item=134362]\n- Girdle of the Moon [item=134047]\n- Glowing Spellbound Lamp [item=134305]\n- Greater Spellbound Lamp [item=134304]\n- Lesser Spellbound Lamp [item=134302]\n- Median Spellbound Lamp [item=134303]\n- Minor Spellbound Lamp [item=134301]\n- Mortal Celestial Brawny Spark [item=133896]\n- Mortal Celestial Deft Spark [item=133897]\n- Mortal Celestial Equilibrium Spark [item=133895]\n- Mortal Celestial Incisive Spark [item=133900]\n- Mortal Celestial Nimble Spark [item=133898]\n- Mortal Celestial Shrewd Spark [item=133901]\n- Mortal Celestial Vigorous Spark [item=133899]",
